h quickly. Beating the 2 with the Red Joker allows me to seize the initiative and play my heavy 5-card combinations (Full Houses), which are difficult for opponents to block and rapidly deplete my hand.\n\nReason: The opponent played a 2, which blocks most responses. I must use the Red Joker to regain the initiative. My hand plan relies on leading with Full Houses (Triplet + Pair), specifically 88855 and 10101099. If I pass, I risk the opponents playing card types I cannot match (like sequences) or bleeding my high cards uselessly. This is the optimal moment to strike and transition to my winning strategy.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["RedJoker"]}'}
